WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
most expensive energy ever conceived,

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.200
and it's actually energy.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.960
You're supposed to make money with energy, not lose money.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.160
You lose money, the governments have to subsidize.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.080
You can't put them out without massive subsidies.

